    "Cost": 1358288,
    "UIName": "Minsk MNK-LR Unlocked",
    "Id": "chassisdef_minsk_MNK-LR_U",
    "Name": "Last Rites",
    "Details": "This was originally the personal Battlemech of legendary MechWarrior saKhan Burt O'Nias, callsign \"St Burt\".  <i>LAST RITES</i>, a modified Minsk 102, was built to his personal combat style. Dominion engineers were instructed to remove the Active Probe and upgrade the engine to a Clan XL.  The core was increased for more power to a 270 and boosting speed further with the addtion of a Supercharger.  With a disdain towards energy loadouts, the mech was retooled to mount Twin Gauss Rifles (C), 5x AP Gauss Rifles and a pair of SRM6 (C) launchers.  \n<color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
